[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
FreeBSD has no systemd, so start hyprKBM's watcher from hyprland.lua:

    hl.on("hyprland.start", function()
        hl.exec_cmd("hyprkbm-watch")
    end)

Without it, binds made in hyprKBM are lost at the next Hyprland reload.

The panel needs Quickshell: pkg install quickshell (x11/quickshell). Its
watcher banner asks systemd, so on FreeBSD it always shows the watcher as
unknown, even when hl.on starts it.
EOM
}
]
